        {
          "summary": "The studio: write one post and send it to all your accounts at once",
          "details_markdown": "Write once in the studio and post it to X, LinkedIn, Bluesky, Threads, Facebook Pages, Instagram, TikTok and YouTube,\nas whichever brand it's for. Each network gets a copy that fits it, and you see how it will look before it goes out.\n\n- Threads, a first comment, alt text, LinkedIn PDF documents, video covers and YouTube thumbnails.\n- Drafts, editing, a weekly posting queue, the best times to post from your own results, repeating posts, staggered\n  accounts, a pause button and bulk scheduling from a spreadsheet.\n- A calendar with drag to reschedule, filters, an Instagram grid and a feed for your calendar app.\n- Preview links that a client or teammate opens without an account to approve or ask for changes.\n- Snippets (hashtag groups, signatures, templates, saved replies), variables and spintax, and a writing assistant that\n  follows each brand's voice.\n- Comments and replies, taking posts down, reposts by your other accounts, an auto-plug reply once a post takes off,\n  and alerts when an account needs reconnecting.\n- Analytics by network, account, format and hashtag, tracked links that count clicks per network, and a CSV export.\n- Posts from RSS feeds, and signed webhooks for Zapier, Make or your own code.",
